      "heading": "What a near miss is",
      "html": "<p>A hazard observation is a fixed condition. Think of a loose handhold or missing edge protection. A near miss is an event where injury was avoided only by luck or quick reaction.</p><p>Record both. A near miss is more urgent, because the danger was live.</p>"
